{
  "title": "スプライン補間",
  "html": "<h1>スプライン補間</h1><p>スプラインは区間ごとに低次多項式を使い、節点で滑らかにつなぐ近似です。高次の単一多項式、補間、ノイズを平滑化するフィッティングを区別します。</p><h2 id=\"model\">対象と代表式</h2><p>非減少のknot列tᵢと次数pに対し、B-spline基底Nᵢ,ₚを定義します。Nᵢ,₀は区間[tᵢ,tᵢ₊₁)の指示関数です。下式で分母が0の項は0と定めます。次数pとorder p+1を混同しません。</p><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{i,p}(x)=\\frac{x-t_i}{t_{i+p}-t_i}N_{i,p-1}(x)+\\frac{t_{i+p+1}-x}{t_{i+p+1}-t_{i+1}}N_{i+1,p-1}(x),\\qquad s(x)=\\sum_i c_iN_{i,p}(x).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:2.2642em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span